RZX Archive catalogue

    libs/rzx/src/main/resources/rzx/rzx-archive.json

    Copyright the RZX Archive <https://www.rzxarchive.co.uk> and the people
    who submitted the recordings it lists, whose names it records.

    Four thousand two hundred and ninety-one entries describing recorded
    playthroughs: a title, a note, the submitter, the archive's own page, the
    Spectrum Computing id of the game, and where the file can be had. It is
    the catalogue and not the recordings - no RZX file is here - and the two
    hundred and forty-three entries the archive marks as distribution denied
    are recorded as such rather than dropped. Gathered from the archive's
    browse pages, one a second, because it offers no interface to ask.

    Read to answer whether a game the browser found has anyone's playthrough
    against it, by an id the two sites share.
